  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FLOPO_0980421">
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A plant anatomical entity phenotype whose distinguishing feature concerns a collection of plant material entities considered together without requiring them to form one connected structure.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Approved FLOPO botanical proposal TOP:plant_material_aggregate_phenotype; local supporting classes remain biologically parented beneath PO or PATO rather than beneath a provenance-only extension class.</obo:IAO_0000116>
