    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A flora phenotype in which a bract has the quality chestnut colour.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">ISCC-NBS colour backbone migration (curator decision 2026-09-18): the former logical definition used 'chestnut colour' (PATO:0104329), which has no exact backbone class. The EquivalentTo axiom was replaced by SubClassOf with the covering colour 'reddish brown' (PATO:0001287); the class keeps its identifier.</obo:IAO_0000116>
