  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FLOPO_0981042">
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A flora phenotype in which a seed has the quality chocolate brown.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">ISCC-NBS colour backbone migration (curator decision 2026-09-18): the former logical definition used 'chocolate brown' (PATO:0104333), which has no exact backbone class. The EquivalentTo axiom was replaced by SubClassOf with the covering colour 'grayish reddish brown' (FLOPO:0988072); the class keeps its identifier.</obo:IAO_0000116>
    <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Provisional exact PO-PATO phenotype class admitted by independent machine review and adversarial validation; occurrence annotations require separate review and this class is not human reviewed.</obo:IAO_0000116>
