  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FLOPO_0989316">
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A flora phenotype affecting a(n) corymb inflorescence or one of its parts.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Bearer phenotype parent minted for the NCVC Saudi guide EQ classes. Curator decision D1 (Robert Hoehndorf, 2026-09-18): mint FLOPO EQ phenotype classes for the NCVC Saudi guide's PO x PATO candidates through the reviewed-combination path.</obo:IAO_0000116>
